1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:06,092
This drive looks like another planet!

2
00:00:06,092 --> 00:00:09,148
Fresh pie in an old pioneer orchard.

3
00:00:09,148 --> 00:00:13,988
A desert so strange, people practice living on Mars here.

4
00:00:13,988 --> 00:00:17,130
And thousands of little rock goblins!

5
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:23,196
This is Capitol Reef to Goblin Valley: about 80 miles through south-central Utah.

6
00:00:23,196 --> 00:00:26,480
Stick around till the end for the full trip planner!

7
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:28,556
Here's the plan!

8
00:00:28,556 --> 00:00:34,540
We start in Torrey, then Capitol Reef and Hanksville, and we finish at Goblin Valley!

9
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:40,740
We're starting in Torrey, a little town with some of the darkest night skies in the country!

10
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:49,420
East on Highway 24, and into Capitol Reef National Park, along a wrinkle in the Earth nearly 100 miles long!

11
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:51,852
Welcome to Capitol Reef!

12
00:00:51,852 --> 00:01:01,730
In the old orchard town of Fruita, grab a fresh-baked pie at the Gifford Homestead, then check out the petroglyphs carved into the cliffs by the Fremont people.

13
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:06,157
Out of the park, and into the gray badlands.

14
00:01:06,157 --> 00:01:09,160
It looks like another planet out here!

15
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:11,540
Welcome to Hanksville!

16
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:17,065
Out here, the land looks so much like Mars that people practice Mars missions nearby.

17
00:01:17,065 --> 00:01:19,730
Grab a burger at Stan's, then head north.

18
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:26,680
North on Highway 24, then west across the desert to Goblin Valley State Park!

19
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,497
We made it to Goblin Valley!

20
00:01:29,497 --> 00:01:34,363
Thousands of little rock goblins, and you can wander right in among them.

21
00:01:34,363 --> 00:01:38,030
This place even played an alien planet in Galaxy Quest!

22
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:40,689
And that's the drive!

23
00:01:40,689 --> 00:01:44,270
About 80 miles from Torrey to Goblin Valley.

24
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:48,598
Here's your trip planner, everything in one place.

25
00:01:48,598 --> 00:01:50,490
Pause and grab a screenshot!

26
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,283
Thanks for riding along!

27
00:01:55,283 --> 00:02:02,510
Subscribe to Road Trip Atlas for more Utah road trips, and next time we're in Moab, for Arches and Canyonlands!
